    {
      "level": 11,
      "id": "phonics-l11",
      "text": "Listen to both consonants at the start of blue. blue. clap. flag. glad. Listen and compare. play. pray. glass. grass. Now try the sentence. The blue flag flies above the plane.",
      "sampleCount": 5
    },
    {
      "level": 12,
