      "text": "Listen to both consonants at the start of brown. brown. crab. dress. frog. Listen and compare. grass. glass. fry. fly. Now try the sentence. A green frog rests by the tree.",
      "sampleCount": 5
    },
    {
      "level": 13,
      "id": "phonics-l13",
      "text": "Keep the first consonants together. Listen to spin and street. spin. stop. skin. smile. Listen and compare. spin. pin. stop. top. Now try the sentence. The strong swimmer starts slowly.",
      "sampleCount": 5
