      "text": "Listen to ship and chip. The start of chip has a short stop. ship. fish. chair. lunch. Listen and compare. ship. chip. wash. watch. Now try the sentence. She chose fresh fish for lunch.",
      "sampleCount": 5
    },
    {
      "level": 15,
      "id": "phonics-l15",
      "text": "Listen to think and this. Your voice starts in this. think. bath. this. mother. Listen and compare. thin. sin. then. den. Now try the sentence. Those three things are over there.",
