      "text": "Listen to hop, then hope. The vowel changes. home. note. rose. stone. Listen and compare. hop. hope. not. note. Now try the sentence. Rose wrote a note at home.",
      "sampleCount": 5
    },
    {
      "level": 20,
      "id": "phonics-l20",
      "text": "Listen to cub and cube. Then listen to these. cube. June. rule. theme. Listen and compare. cub. cube. cut. cute. Now try the sentence. June chose these cute cubes.",
      "sampleCount": 5
