      "text": "Listen to the same vowel in rain and day. rain. train. day. play. Listen and compare. paid. pad. day. die. Now try the sentence. We may take the train on a rainy day.",
      "sampleCount": 5
    },
    {
      "level": 22,
      "id": "phonics-l22",
      "text": "Listen to the long vowel in green and leaf. green. sleep. leaf. team. Listen and compare. ship. sheep. fit. feet. Now try the sentence. The team reads beneath the green tree.",
      "sampleCount": 5
    },
    {
      "level": 23,
      "id": "phonics-l23",
      "text": "Listen to the same vowel in boat and snow. boat. road. snow. window. Listen and compare. coat. cot. low. law. Now try the sentence. The boat moves slowly past the yellow house.",
      "sampleCount": 5
    },
    {
      "level": 24,
