      "text": "Listen to fool and full. Compare the two vowels. moon. food. book. good. Listen and compare. fool. full. pool. pull. Now try the sentence. The cook put good food by the cool pool.",
      "sampleCount": 5
    },
    {
      "level": 25,
      "id": "phonics-l25",
      "text": "Listen to car and core. Notice how each accent treats the ending. car. star. fork. short. Listen and compare. car. core. park. pork. Now try the sentence. A short storm passed over the farm.",
      "sampleCount": 5
    },
    {
      "level": 26,
